        <detaileddescription>
<para>Set Reasoner.</para>
<para>When set, <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1kg_1_1_knowledge_graph_retriever_1aad2b15e4c14f83624bfcc2c192327117" kindref="member">retrieve()</ref></computeroutput> calls <computeroutput>KnowledgeGraphReasoner::infer()</computeroutput> for each linked query entity and includes the resulting <computeroutput>InferenceChain</computeroutput> in the <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1kg_1_1_k_g_retrieval_result_1adb28f561ab955699ec3479a062fd07a3" kindref="member">KGRetrievalResult::inference_chains</ref></computeroutput> list. When <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1kg_1_1_k_g_retriever_config_1afdd95bd54cb2bca9d17cda5ef6ad233b" kindref="member">KGRetrieverConfig::attach_reasoning_chain_to_metadata</ref></computeroutput> is true, the chain is also serialised into <computeroutput>RetrievedDocument::metadata["reasoning_chain"]</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Pass <computeroutput>nullptr</computeroutput> to detach the current reasoner.</para>
