    <briefdescription>
<para>Augments a set of retrieved documents using a knowledge graph. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The retriever:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Links query entities to KG nodes.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Performs BFS traversal from linked nodes to collect a neighbourhood.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>For each candidate document, links its entities to the same KG.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Computes a KG boost score = overlap between document entity neighbourhood and query neighbourhood (normalised Jaccard).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fuses the original similarity score with the KG boost using <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1kg_1_1_k_g_retriever_config_1a8e637a796e936604bbf2149008d5b6d9" kindref="member">KGRetrieverConfig::kg_score_weight</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Returns documents sorted by final fused score.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Performance targets:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&lt;10 ms for 100 candidates with graph of 1 000 nodes / 5 000 edges.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Linear in |candidates| × average entity count per document. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
